🍨🔥 Baked Alaska Made with Ninja Creami Ice Cream – A Dessert Showstopper! 🔥🍨

In this video, I’m making a stunning Baked Alaska featuring homemade ice cream crafted in the Ninja Creami! From velvety layers of eggnog ice cream to fluffy meringue browned to perfection, this dessert is as delicious as it is spectacular. Whether you’re a dessert enthusiast or just looking to impress guests, this recipe has everything you need!

Baked Alaska is the ultimate combination of hot and cold, with a soft, creamy center and a toasted meringue shell. Pair it with your favorite flavors of Ninja Creami ice cream for a truly personal touch!

